==Battleground==
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**6 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a relatively straightforward and easy stage. Spam meatshields like [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] and [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Macho Cat]], and spam area attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]], [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats,]] [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] to take out the Aku Gories, Pigeon de Sables and other peons. [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can be useful as well to keep the enemies at bay.

